      ],
      "source": "https://esshissoc.org.au/localhistory/timeline/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1906, the North Melbourne Electric Tramway and Lighting Company opened an electric tramway linking Essendon with the city.",
